{"headword":"שֵׁשׁ","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> et <strong>f.six</strong>;—<strong>m.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁשׁ</span> (c. <strong>n.f.</strong>) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:41\" href=\"/Genesis.31.41\">Gn 31:41</a> + 120 times; <strong>f.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁשָּׁה</span> (c. n.m.) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:20\" href=\"/Genesis.30.20\">30:20</a> + 39 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁ֫שֶׁת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:12\" href=\"/Exodus.23.12\">Ex 23:12</a> + 30 times (6 + 10 = 16 are additional);—<em>six</em> (Hex chiefly P):"},{"senses":[{"definition":"no other num.:"},{"senses":[{"definition":"bef. n.pl. 75 times: e.g. <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁשׁ שָׁנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:2\" href=\"/Exodus.21.2\">Ex 21:2</a> (E) + 11 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁשׁ אַמּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.4\">1 S 17:4</a> + 8 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁשׁ בָּאַמָּה</span> †<a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:6\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.6\">1 K 6:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁשָּׁה בָּנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:20\" href=\"/Genesis.30.20\">Gn 30:20</a> (E) + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁשֶׁת יָמִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:12\" href=\"/Exodus.23.12\">Ex 23:12</a> (E) + 14 times; after n. (late) †<a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:2\" href=\"/Exodus.28.2\">Ex 28:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:59\" href=\"/Joshua.15.59\">Jos 15:59</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:62\" href=\"/Joshua.15.62\">62</a> (all P), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:27\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.27\">1 Ch 4:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.17\">26:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 5:18\" href=\"/Nehemiah.5.18\">Ne 5:18</a>; rarely n. om. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:6\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.6\">Lv 24:6</a> (P) + (distrib. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.20\">2 S 21:20</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.6\">1 Ch 20:6</a>)."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"= ordin. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁנַת שֵׁשׁ לְחִזְק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.10\">2 K 18:10</a> (Ges<sup>§ 134 o</sup>)."}],"num":"b."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"16, c. <strong>n.f.</strong>: <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁשׁ עֶשְׂרֵה</span>, bef. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָ֑פֶשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:18\" href=\"/Genesis.46.18\">Gn 46:18</a> (P), <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.10\">2 K 13:10</a> + 9 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּנוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 13:21\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.13.21\">2 Ch 13:21</a>; after <span dir=\"rtl\">עָרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:41\" href=\"/Joshua.15.41\">Jos 15:41</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:22\" href=\"/Joshua.19.22\">19:22</a> (P); c. <strong>n.m.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁשָׁה עָשָׂר</span>, bef. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲדָנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:25\" href=\"/Exodus.26.25\">Ex 26:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:30\" href=\"/Exodus.36.30\">36:30</a> (P), also <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶלֶף</span>, 1000, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:40\" href=\"/Numbers.31.40\">Nu 31:40</a> + (P); after <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:27\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.27\">1 Ch 4:27</a>, etc.; = ordin. 16<em>th</em> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.14\">1 Ch 24:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 25:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.25.23\">25:23</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם שׁ׳ ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.17\">2 Ch 29:17</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"600 = <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁשׁ מֵאוֹת</span>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:6\" href=\"/Genesis.7.6\">Gn 7:6</a> (P) + 63 times; 6000 = <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁשֶׁת אֲלָפִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:34\" href=\"/Numbers.3.34\">Nu 3:34</a> (P) + 8 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ אֶלֶף</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:15\" href=\"/Judges.20.15\">Ju 20:15</a> + 2 times"}],"num":"3."},{"se